---
// Case Studies grounded directly in Dimaz Devriza's real production projects
---

<section id="case-studies" class="py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="mb-16 reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 text-xs font-mono text-accent mb-3">
        <span>FEATURED ENGINEERING</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
        Production Case Studies
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Real-world systems engineered for real businesses. Because two of these systems manage proprietary operational data, these case studies emphasize architecture, concurrency handling, and problem solving.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-16">

      <!-- Case Study 1: D'Royal Village Multi-Warehouse Logistics & Cost Control -->
      <article class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-card-border hover:border-slate-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        
        <!-- Header row -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30">
                Proprietary Enterprise System
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Padang, Indonesia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Jan 2026 - Oct 2026
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
              D'Royal Village: Logistics & Project Cost Control
            </h3>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold border border-emerald-500/20">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              In Active Production
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Designed, built, and deployed an integrated enterprise logistics and project cost-control web application for housing developer D'Royal Village. Replaced error-prone manual Excel workflows with a multi-warehouse, multi-cluster management platform.
        </p>

        <!-- Technical Deep-Dive Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
          
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
              </svg>
              ACID & Pessimistic Concurrency
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Implemented database transactions with pessimistic row locking (<code class="text-sky-300 font-mono">lockForUpdate()</code>) on material batches. Prevents stock race conditions when multiple warehouse supervisors record transfers simultaneously.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
              </svg>
              Batch-Price Inventory & House Costing
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Material valuation is tracked per purchase-price batch. Material usage is billed directly to specific housing units, enabling live comparisons between estimated project budget (RAB) and physical realization.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path>
              </svg>
              Asset & Heavy Machinery Tracking
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Work tool loan lifecycle with return condition verification (good, damaged, lost). Cluster expense monitoring and heavy equipment rental tracking backed by digital receipt verification.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
              </svg>
              Strict Multi-Role Security (RBAC)
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Dedicated permission matrices for Logistics Staff, Project Supervisors, Finance Officers, and System Administrators, enforcing separation of duties on financial records.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Interactive Architecture Flow Diagram (Apple Mac Window Style) -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/90 overflow-hidden mb-6">
          <div class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-900/90 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="flex gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80 inline-block"></span>
              </div>
              <span class="ml-2 font-semibold text-slate-300">Architecture: ACID Transaction & Concurrency Flow</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 hidden sm:inline">Production Schema Logic</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 overflow-x-auto">
            <div class="min-w-[600px] flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
              
              <!-- Step 1 -->
              <div class="flex-1 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-accent block mb-1">STEP 01</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-white block">Stock Request</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Supervisor assigns batch to Unit</span>
              </div>

              <div class="text-slate-600 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

              <!-- Step 2 -->
              <div class="flex-1 p-3 rounded-lg bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-800/60 text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-sky-400 block mb-1">STEP 02: LOCKING</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-sky-200 block">lockForUpdate()</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Pessimistic row lock on batch</span>
              </div>

              <div class="text-slate-600 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

              <!-- Step 3 -->
              <div class="flex-1 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-accent block mb-1">STEP 03</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-white block">Validation</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Qty checked vs physical reserve</span>
              </div>

              <div class="text-slate-600 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>

              <!-- Step 4 -->
              <div class="flex-1 p-3 rounded-lg bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-800/60 text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 block mb-1">STEP 04</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-emerald-200 block">Commit Transaction</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Cost billed to RAB Unit & Log saved</span>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Stack Pill Badges -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mr-2">Core Stack:</span>
          {["Laravel 11", "Livewire", "Alpine.js", "Tailwind CSS", "MySQL", "Git", "Pessimistic Locking", "RBAC"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/50">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>

      </article>


      <!-- Case Study 2: SMA Negeri 15 Padang Learning Management System (LMS) -->
      <article class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-card-border hover:border-slate-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/30">
                Education Sector
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Padang, Indonesia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Mar 2026 - Jul 2026
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
              SMA Negeri 15 Padang: Learning Management System
            </h3>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold border border-emerald-500/20">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              Actively Used By School
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Collaborated with a fellow developer to architect, build, and deploy an end-to-end Learning Management System (LMS) for high school teachers and students at SMA Negeri 15 Padang. The platform is actively used in the school's day-to-day academic routines.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Collaborative Architecture
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Team development with Git version control, structured branch workflows, and modular codebase division between academic modules and grading pipelines.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Material & Exam Delivery
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Digital syllabus distribution, student assignment submission with file validation, and teacher grading records with automated score summaries.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Production Git Deployment
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Managed live server setup and deployment pipelines using Git on Rumahweb hosting infrastructure, ensuring dependable uptime and automated updates.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mr-2">Core Stack:</span>
          {["Laravel", "PHP", "MySQL", "Tailwind CSS", "Git", "Rumahweb Hosting", "Server Deployment"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/50">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>

      </article>


      <!-- Case Study 3: LLDIKTI X SiLAB -->
      <article class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-card-border hover:border-slate-700 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/30">
                Government Agency Internship
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Padang, Indonesia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/60">
                Jun 2025 - Oct 2025
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
              LLDIKTI Wilayah X: SiLAB (Lab Booking Information System)
            </h3>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300 text-xs font-semibold border border-slate-600/40">
              Completed & Evaluated
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          During my internship at LLDIKTI Wilayah X office, maintained, enhanced, and optimized the web-based Laboratory Booking Information System (SiLAB). Upgraded user registration, document upload/download validation, and administrative verification workflows for higher education institutions.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Verification & Workflow Optimization
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Refactored administrator verification queues to eliminate booking scheduling conflicts and streamline institution credential checks.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-2">
              Secure Document Handling
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Implemented structured PDF and documentation verification systems, ensuring uploaded compliance files are safely organized and accessible.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mr-2">Core Stack:</span>
          {["PHP Native", "MySQL", "Bootstrap", "Git", "Document Verification", "Relational Database"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/50">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
